stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> open: issue created by a quality run
    open --> in_progress: status changed
    in_progress --> resolved: status changed or marked done
    open --> resolved: marked done
    resolved --> open: status changed
    in_progress --> open: status changed
    note right of open
        Each change to status or assignee
        writes an audit event.
        A save with no change writes none.
    end note
